          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "दिन (din) is Sanskrit dina, \"day\". CDIAL lists Hindi and Gujarati din under it and thinks the Gujarati and Marathi forms were taken back from Sanskrit (CDIAL 6328); it gives no Marwari form."
            }
          ]
